name anonchap
category Package
revision 17049
shortdesc Make chapters be typeset like sections
relocated 1
longdesc The command \simplechapter sets up the \chapter command not to
longdesc number chapters, though they may possibly have a prefix, and a
longdesc suffix (the \simplechapterdelim command, which the user may
longdesc alter). The \restorechapter command restores the status quo
longdesc ante.
runfiles size=1
